#. module: atmta_procurement_control
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:atmta_procurement_control.action_approval_rule
msgid ""
"A requisition needs a decision from every rule that matches it.\n"
"            Every dimension is optional and an unset one matches everything, so\n"
"            one row is a working configuration. Changing a rule never rewrites\n"
"            an approval that has already been given — the steps keep their own\n"
"            copy of the authority they were raised under."
msgstr ""

#. module: atmta_procurement_control
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:atmta_procurement_control.action_procurement_reservation
msgid ""
"A reservation is approved demand consuming purchasing capacity\n"
"            before anybody is owed anything. It is not a commitment, not an\n"
"            encumbrance and not a journal entry — confirming a purchase order\n"
"            converts it into Construction commitment, and the two never exist\n"
"            for the same money at the same time."
msgstr ""

